== door before box (Precedence + Existence) (graphs/door-before-box.rm)
  hard Precedence(door_open, target_picked_up): (((~target_picked_up)Udoor_open)|(G(~target_picked_up)))
  hard Existence(target_picked_up): (Ftarget_picked_up)
  u0: owes 2 (start)
  u2: owes 1 (started)
  u3: owes 0 (final)
  pay order: finished 12 > started 1 > not started 0 > hard break -10; ok
== never both drop the key and open the door, + box (graphs/never-both-box.rm)
  hard NotCoExistence(key_lost, door_open): ((Fkey_lost)->(~(Fdoor_open)))
  hard Existence(target_picked_up): (Ftarget_picked_up)
  u0: owes 1 (start)
  u1: owes 0 (final)
  u2: owes 1 (not started)
  u3: owes 1 (not started)
  pay order: finished 11 > not started 0 > hard break -10; ok
