== key, then door, then box (Existence per step) (graphs/key-door-box-chain.rm)
  hard Existence(has_key): (Fhas_key)
  hard Existence(door_open): (Fdoor_open)
  hard Existence(target_picked_up): (Ftarget_picked_up)
  hard Precedence(has_key, door_open): (((~door_open)Uhas_key)|(G(~door_open)))
  hard Precedence(door_open, target_picked_up): (((~target_picked_up)Udoor_open)|(G(~target_picked_up)))
  u0: owes 3 (start)
  u2: owes 2 (started)
  u3: owes 1 (started)
  u4: owes 0 (final)
  pay order: finished 13 > started 2 > not started 0 > hard break -10; ok
